    {
      "title": "Letter sounds",
      "body": "ک kaaf = k  ·  گ gaaf = g  ·  ل laam = l  ·  م meem = m  ·  ن noon = n  ·  ں noon ghunna = nasal sound at the end (as in main, hain)  ·  و wao = w / v, or the vowels oo and o  ·  ہ he = h  ·  ھ do-chashmi he = the 'h' in bh, ph, kh, gh, chh  ·  ی ye = y, or the vowel ee  ·  ے bari ye = the vowel e / ai at the end of a word"
    }
